{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1306","text":"コマシンクロのスイッチ、オンの状態でお願いします。","label":"panel_sync_set","slots":{"enabled":true},"group":"v03_dev_panel_setting_states","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","nominal_state_request"],"note":"希望するスイッチ状態がオンと明示された依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
