{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1313","text":"内枠スナップはオフじゃなくて、オンを選んで。","label":"inner_frame_snap_set","slots":{"enabled":true},"group":"v03_dev_panel_setting_states","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","excluded_alternative"],"note":"否定されたオフを数えず、オンへの設定一件。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
