{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1318","text":"しばらくコマスナップは要らないから、オフに変えてくれる？","label":"panel_gap_snap_set","slots":{"enabled":false},"group":"v03_dev_panel_setting_states","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","reason_then_question"],"note":"不要という説明だけでなくオフへの変更を明示。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1319","text":"設定のコマスナップ、オンでお願いします。","label":"panel_gap_snap_set","slots":{"enabled":true},"group":"v03_dev_panel_setting_states","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","nominal_state_request"],"note":"設定名と希望状態オンを示した依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1320","text":"コマスナップが効かない状態にしてから描きたい。今、無効にして。","label":"panel_gap_snap_set","slots":{"enabled":false},"group":"v03_dev_panel_setting_states","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","plan_then_current_setting"],"note":"描くという希望は実行指示に数えず、今の無効化だけを依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
